  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed a CFG001 precision gap found by evidence-based audit: conditional access (?.) anywhere in a GetSection(...)/GetRequiredSection(...) chain -- a non-chained call, ?. immediately after the root, or ?. before a further chained call off a genuine root configuration chain -- was not unwrapped by the section-path resolver, so the analyzer silently skipped the section-existence check for that registration instead of checking it. Diagnostic IDs and severities are unchanged.",
